cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this code, please cite it using the metadata below. Once the
  accompanying paper is published, please cite the paper instead; a
  preferred-citation block will be added here at that point.
title: >-
  Analysis code for apolipoprotein B goal assignment and attainment under
  the 2026 ACC/AHA dyslipidemia guideline (NHANES 2005-2016)
abstract: >-
  R code implementing Figure 1 of the 2026 ACC/AHA dyslipidemia guideline
  across six NHANES cycles (2005-2016), and computing apolipoprotein B goal
  assignment, goal attainment, and the associated sensitivity analyses.
  Because Figure 1's patient-population rows overlap and the guideline states
  no precedence rule, goals are assigned by an order-independent union rule:
  a goal applies if any matched row states one, and where matched rows differ
  the most stringent value applies. No data are distributed; the NHANES cycles
  and the NCHS linked mortality files are downloaded from CDC at run time.
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/parackal03/apob-goals-2026-guideline"
